      "source": "import math\n\ndef retry_delays(base, cap, attempts):\n    if attempts <= 0:\n        return []\n    \n    delays = []\n    for i in range(attempts):\n        delay = min(cap, base * (2**i))\n        delays.append(delay)\n    return delays\n",
